<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    body {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .expired-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
    }
    .expired-icon {
      font-size: 5rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes float {
      0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50%      { transform: translateY(-12px); }
    }
    .expired-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 36px 28px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .expired-card h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--danger);
    }
    .expired-card .subtitle {
      color: var(--gray-400);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .price-mini {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .price-mini-item {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 10px 6px;
    }
    .price-mini-item .amt {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: var(--mono);
    }
    .price-mini-item .dur {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--gray-400);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="bg-network"></div>
  <div class="expired-wrapper">
    <div class="expired-icon">⏱️</div>

    <div class="expired-card">
      <h1>Natapos na!</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Your session has expired.<br>
        <strong style="color:var(--white);">Naubos na ang iyong oras.</strong>
      </p>

      <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--gray-400); margin-bottom:12px;">
        Bumili ng bagong voucher para makakonekta ulit.<br>
        <small>Purchase a new voucher to reconnect.</small>
      </p>

      <div class="price-mini">
        <div class="price-mini-item">
          <div class="amt">₱5</div>
          <div class="dur">30 Minuto</div>
        </div>
        <div class="price-mini-item">
          <div class="amt">₱10</div>
          <div class="dur">1 Oras</div>
        </div>
        <div class="price-mini-item">
          <div class="amt">₱20</div>
          <div class="dur">3 Oras</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" style="margin-top:8px;">
        🔄 Kumuha ng Bagong Code / Get New Voucher
      </a>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--gray-400);">
      📍 Sam's WiFi – Taytay, Rizal<br>
      May tanong? Makipag-ugnayan kay Sam.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
